{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_bgsnow_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_bgsnow_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"墨跡已落","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_bgsnow_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"d9730db96d971266b3e084ea17baa9ac2ed0e7b8538aae0410964863f407510b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"初到際崖城時，鴻雪委託杜林工匠為自己做一支鋼筆，想以此告別往昔，但工匠們遲遲沒有交付訂單。於是她決定去搞清楚這是怎麼一回事。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"“比刀劍更銳利，比雪原更冰冷，比回憶更沉重。”\n“我也不知道，自己是否還能忍住心臟的刺痛，將它拿起。”\n“我並不指望用它書寫什麼，或許我更希望它成為我舊日收藏的最後一個段落。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g6_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是委託的細節，我保證，一字不差地記下來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能確定嗎？尤其是後面這幾句，她當時說得那麼小聲，你確定沒聽錯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不確定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都已經過去半個月了，你怎麼還記得她當時說話很小聲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不覺得有點奇怪嗎？她前面說的是想要一支鋼筆，按照我們的風格設計就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後面這些話，你確定她是對我們說的，不是自言自語？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不確定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊，等等。已經過去半個月了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還沒開始設計？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是才半個月嘛。之前我的鉛筆頭沒削好，還有......蜜酒也喝完了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也對。來，先乾一杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乾杯！——呃，老兄，你覺得她的要求是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看這些詞......這些詞的意思應該是說，很能打，很冷，很重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦，那應該是某種金屬做的，大塊頭武器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後加一點鋼筆的設計。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加一點就行了？那我覺得加在這裡好看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！雖然你只是隨手畫了一些線條，但感覺還是不錯的草圖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以這是個什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來......像弩。你覺得呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有那麼點像，我可以動筆設計結構了。相信我，這絕對會是一件偉大的作品，比《奇談怪論》裡面的所有記錄都更新奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就對啦，不然怎麼能讓一個來自地上的訪客滿意呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說得好，再乾一杯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慶祝今天的工作結束！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g5_library_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“......這是際崖城歷史上最大的螢光蘑菇。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，這本《傳奇探險者的際崖城大揭秘》裡面，也沒有多少有效資訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三年間的十七版礦洞路線圖......並不能反映這座城市經歷了怎樣的動盪，當權者又有怎樣的野心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許我要去搜尋更早期外來者留下的書籍，或者學會杜林語，才能從這些故作歡樂的破碎詞句中琢磨出際崖城的歷史。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......畢竟，我親眼所見的絕非虛假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的每一個人都酗酒成性，每一個人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_1"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g5_library_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我已經從那裡走出來了......我要忘記那片土地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些杜林人或許也一樣。他們一定有某種極其傷痛的集體回憶，因此默契地共同酩酊大醉、共同逃避。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不瞭解他們的悲痛與禁忌，我就無法融入他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們只是表現得無憂無慮，內心卻並沒有接納我，甚至對我充滿敵意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然，為什麼半個月過去，我委託他們做的鋼筆還毫無消息？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，阿芙朵嘉，有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊，不好意思，我是不是在圖書館裡說話聲音太大了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走過那樣漫長又孤獨的旅途後，我實在難以改掉自言自語的習慣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醉醺醺的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你——看！我說什麼來著！我們比賽吃堅果霜淇淋的事情，是在第一千二百零一期上記錄的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"比較冷靜的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，你把書拿反了，這是第一千零五十一期。再說，這上面的照片也不是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得你的聲音不算很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，之前你說你害怕圖書館的機器人會是什麼，呃，軍隊設施之類的，所以我讓它們都不要靠近你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要找什麼書的話，就直接叫我來幫你吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我你們的圖書分類索引法就可以了，這樣我自己就能找到需要的書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，圖書分類索引法......我記得是專門寫了一本書的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我也不記得那本書放在哪裡了，稍等，我把梯子搬來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索引裡沒有規定過該放在哪裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這個我也不記得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，百分之八十的書籍擺放位置是不符合分類索引的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用你幫忙了，多謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是去街上走走吧，應該能找到融入你們的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿芙朵嘉，你這麼喜歡待在圖書館，有沒有考慮過為際崖城寫書？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很好奇，像《奇談怪論》裡那樣的地上人，會怎麼看待這座杜林人的城......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我冒犯到你了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，只不過這是我自己要面對的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了徹底擺脫在地上的那些回憶，我不願意再做和過去相似的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真可惜，原來你的志向不是成為文學家。那就去開闊的地方看看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離開時將借閱的書隨便放在哪個書架上都可以。還有，出門時小心，最近門口經常有喝醉的杜林人賽跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......多謝提醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我還有一個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，阿芙朵嘉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們杜林人的姓氏是什麼樣的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有什麼規定。舉例來說，我的姓氏是銀幣，長老的姓氏是地心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都源自事物的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（對杜林人來說那只是尋常的姓氏，我卻無法忽視詞語的含義和隱喻。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝，我明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g1_durinstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無處不在的人造日光，永遠沒有冬天的城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要怎樣才能藏起自己身上風雪的氣息，避免自己刺痛杜林人挑剔的眼睛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果要拋下過去的一切，棲身在他人的穹頂下，只為不受驅逐、不被出賣......我求之不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得，那兩名工匠的小屋就在這——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大滑梯......但是沒有爬上去的梯子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"半張蹦床，還沒有護欄......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這都是什麼東西？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，這裡......為什麼全都是建了一半的遊樂設施，還擠在一起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，之前這裡是不是有一家接受委託的工匠鋪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！又抓到了一個人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抓？你們要把我抓到哪裡去？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然是投票現場！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，看你這麼驚訝，難道你也是長居室內派？居然錯過了這條街的改建大賽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這都已經是第三批比賽作品了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了方便大家投票決定這條街要改建成什麼樣子，這次大賽採用了一個新規則。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每個參賽者都建了自己的設計方案的一部分，然後——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——觀眾投票選擇“最想看到哪個設施建完的樣子”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，是不是更有吸引力了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我只關心這條街上原來的人去了哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們就這樣被驅逐了嗎？或是被流放到杜林人暗無天日的礦洞裡......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我們去投票！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這是杜林人的生活方式，那我怎麼能拒絕呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我個子這麼高，站在人群裡就會很顯眼，要是我的選擇和大多數人不同，杜林人會怎麼看我呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對哦，你這麼高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你很適合當記錄員進行計票欸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我們預先找了三個記錄員，但是他們好像今天都喝醉了沒有來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以現在，記錄員的位置的確是空著的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。那我們走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g4_durinsquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“超級酒精大攪拌碰碰車”，二十票！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有棄權票，三百零九票！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"超過一半的人哪個都沒選呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼，杜林人的說話方式實在是太難模仿了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論我多麼渴望融入杜林人的生活......我似乎也不願意用“筆錄”之類的詞語作為自己的姓氏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是有這麼多人棄權啊。看來，我們只能展開第四輪比拼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是遊樂設施已經不流行了？要不下次我們以藝術雕塑為主題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，反正我的設計總是會比你的更受人喜歡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為參賽設計師，你們應該對那條街道很熟悉吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你們知不知道半個月前，那條街上有一家由兩個工匠開的店鋪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去那裡委託他們幫我做一支鋼筆，他們答應下來之後就消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是那個吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不小心把你的委託忘記了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然拆房子的時候他們應該會聯繫你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這種路邊順手幫個忙的小事，忘了也不會釀成大禍，放心吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事對我來說很重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，你是鋼筆愛好者！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你喜歡書法？還是喜歡寫文章？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來來來，別愁眉苦臉的，反正要建大工程的時候，沒喝醉的工匠基本上都會來幫忙，到時候你就能找到他們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如說，等眼前這場比賽有了結果的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，說到比賽，我覺得你很適合給我提供靈感！快告訴我，地上是什麼樣的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，這是我要問的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼我們現在發起投票，決定一下她要把來自地上的靈感分享給誰吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——停。不用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道不想講？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我講給你們兩個人聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只希望立刻有人拿出一個能說服所有杜林人的方案，這樣我就能儘快找到我委託的那兩名工匠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"追殺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦——我明白了！你說的是可以干擾別人的追逐賽！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高高的圍牆！但是在狹小的走道裡對峙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大宴會廳，所有人都醉倒了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暴力！超級暴力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經有想法了！我們走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些杜林人......難道真的不理解追殺和投毒是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。我剛剛把這些醜惡的知識教給了他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“她心中浮現的只是......隔絕寒氣的高大石牆，鋪滿裝飾畫的迴廊，擺放著熱食與酒的長桌......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“但是她的句子一旦從這裡開始，就必須寫到高牆崩毀，面容慈愛的畫像在火中燃燒，鮮紅的酒倒在潔白的餐布上。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經打翻了酒杯，罪惡的念頭一旦被啟發就無法再根除。眼下我能做的只有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有阻止他們在際崖城繼續散播這些故事！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g7_durinhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼之前從來沒有想到過！明明還有這種比賽方式！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，這樣我們就可以長久地互相較量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是——“超級大水炮對戰”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，我會在每個窗口都放上水槍，保證水槍能打到街對面你設計的玩意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，如果我們兩個人中間只有一個人能被投票選為大家最想玩到的設施，那不就沒法對戰了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，你說得對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我們應該組成設計團隊參加第四次比賽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好主意！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g10_lakegarden"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"抱著酒桶的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想幫我們推銷新的蜜酒？嗯......你是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我是好酒之人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"抱著酒桶的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦——喜歡我們釀的蜜酒，你很有品味嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來這裡之後，我見到杜林人喝這種酒，幾乎都是一杯就倒......我想這應該是很烈的酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"抱著酒桶的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，沒錯！就連我，兩杯下肚也會醉好幾天！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得，也許您用的杯子稍微大了一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過那真是太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事不宜遲，就讓我現在立刻推著酒出發吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（只要以推銷的方式請那兩個設計師喝酒，她們就不會起疑心，反而會痛快地喝到酩酊大醉。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（讓她們睡過設計大賽截止日，那些來自地上的故事就不會透過她們的設計被散播出去了，說不定還能徹底被遺忘。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"抱著酒桶的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，為了我們的推銷順利進行，先乾一杯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，我從來沒喝過酒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（見過那麼多銳利的視線，我怎麼敢喝酒？我怎麼可能在日光下安睡？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我是說，為了工作，我必須保持清醒，還是晚點再乾杯吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我走啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g4_durinsquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位，你們想試喝一下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說得好，芬奇大師！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——看來不想啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真厲害啊，優美而又簡潔的建築線條，絕不會導致空間浪費在多餘的曲面上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且他說得對，經過設計之後這條商業街的採光會和直射人造日光有些許區別。在這樣的光線下，一些商品會顯得更有誘惑力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我迫不及待地想看到芬奇的天才設計了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我們一開始是想在那裡建遊樂設施來著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"台上的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，同意這一方案的請舉手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只憑目測，也能看出支持者占大多數。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是那位設計師不是一直在台上指責杜林人的生活方式嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，這樣我們的設計就泡湯啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟芬奇說得很有道理，現在際崖城裡已經有四分之一的地塊都是遊樂設施了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"期待的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，高個子，你是什麼時候過來的？有沒有聽到芬奇的演講？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，聽到了一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說你們放棄了之前的設計——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是新釀的蜜酒！這個香味，不會錯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"放鬆的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然我們已經這麼熟了，我就不客氣了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你們根本沒有理解那個演講者所說的“有節制的生活”，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不過，這樣也挺好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g1_durinstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓一讓，讓一讓！這是芬奇托我們打造的售貨車，現在我們要試一下它的性能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的杜林人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"加速，繼續加速！繞著前面的廊柱來個急轉彎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是不是空間不夠轉彎了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的杜林人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那做一下碰撞測試吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，還算安全。可能因為後面拖著的車廂裡還沒裝東西吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自從這條街開工之後我就一直在等你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？唔......好像是有點眼熟的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你還記不記得這是誰來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正都躺到地上了，我覺得應該先睡一會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，那我提醒一下你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我認識一個人，她委託這條街上的兩個工匠幫她做一支杜林風格的鋼筆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的行囊中有書，頭腦中有故鄉的文字，但她不願意再觸碰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦提筆，她就會想起自己裹著被雪水浸透的披風，寫下一張又一張無處可去的信箋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼無處可去？通往鄰城的鐵路斷掉了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不好意思，是我跑題了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，她只想給自己封存的舊時光留一個紀念，然後成為......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，成為什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成為抄寫員？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就不算完全告別過去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那她到底是想要這支鋼筆，還是不想要？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這個故事裡，就讓她成為蜜酒推銷員吧！然後她和大家一起快樂地喝酒，酒的香味繞著整個人工湖都能聞到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，哦！這個結局好！我喜歡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好，車上雖然沒有裝別的東西，但是裝了兩桶蜜酒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼，你帶了？你早說我就早從地上爬起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，乾杯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——讓我也來一杯吧，多謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，大約二十天之前，我曾經拜託你們幫我做一支鋼筆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在......請問我的鋼筆呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，哦！是你啊，我想起來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我們做完了，但是忘記是誰找我們做的了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，鋼筆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懶散的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們做的好像不是鋼筆啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚴謹地說，有一部分是鋼筆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但概括地說，我們做了一把弩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......怎麼可能想要一把武器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，雖然我不記得是誰的委託，但你當時說的話我到現在都還記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴謹的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的描述太生動了，就算我不知道為什麼要用一支鋼筆去刺心臟，我也覺得胸口好像中箭了一樣痛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。你們還是再為我做一支鋼筆吧。另外，我還想要一台打字機。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g5_library_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿芙朵嘉，你又來啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我想找一些杜林人之間流行的雜誌，看看怎樣的廣告語比較能吸引大家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種書就在門口的書架上，不會有錯的。畢竟每天都會被很多人翻看嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，阿芙朵嘉，阿芙朵嘉......我最近是不是在哪見過你的名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，為了方便投稿，我模仿著杜林人的風格，給自己也起了一個姓氏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說，我應該是在最近的雜誌上見過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為你不想再寫作了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有兩個杜林人，為我做了一件更適合拿來封存過往回憶的收藏品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於鋼筆和打字機，繼續使用也沒什麼壞處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛柯綺·銀幣","speakerId":"avg_npc_569_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，找到了！阿芙朵嘉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“銳筆”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不得不繼續書寫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，我知道自己不可能真的放下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
